    "text": "bayareatelegraph.com\nwebsite\nMoraga\nThe Bay Area’s Best BBQ Chefs Are Having a Rib “Throwdown” in Moraga, And You’re Invited\nBy Bay Area Telegraph Editorial Team,\n15 hours agoMoraga will sizzle this Saturday, August 23 from 4–8 p.m. as the 1st Annual Moraga Rib Throwdown fires up at Canyon Club Brewery in Moraga, CA. The community event – organized by local resident Jon Ruiz – brings together families, friends and neighbors for a friendly (non-sanctioned) barbecue competition, with all proceeds benefiting the Moraga Education Foundation and local public schools.\n7",
